<title>USA: TransWorld shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>TransWorld shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transworld Bancorp said its shareholders approved the merger with Glendale Federal Bank.</p>
<p>Under the merger agreement, shareholders will receive $18.25 in cash. TransWorld said it expects to finalize the merger in the second half of this year.</p>
</text>
